    "detailed_description": "<i>Playing demo before buying this game is recommended because the game is not designed for mainstream audience.</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simulated Combat</h2><br>Feel the realism of combat with visual simulation of every limb.<br><br>The game has underlying arcade style system where you must wait for the right moment to hit, otherwise you can\u2019t deal damage.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bird Fly Mode</h2><br>Relax from combat in bird mode levels with full gameplay change where you shoot arrows and avoid obstacles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beautiful Terrain</h2><br>The terrain is based on real world topographies which adds realism and immersion to the game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cinematic Soundtrack</h2><br>Enjoy the cinematic music composed by Nicolas Jeudy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><br>Story follows Ari through waves of enemies as he wanders after losing his home village.",
